  "value": "tasks is a list of distinct lowercase strings and dependencies is a list of [fromTask, toTask] pairs over those tasks. Level 0 holds the tasks with no prerequisites; level k + 1 holds the tasks not yet scheduled whose prerequisites are all in levels 0..k. Return the levels in order, each sorted lexicographically. When the dependencies contain a cycle (not every task can be scheduled), return [].",
